1
00:00:00,100 --> 00:00:04,033
Tesla raised R&D spending by nearly 70% in a year

2
00:00:04,053 --> 00:00:06,102
That money goes to three places

3
00:00:06,122 --> 00:00:11,291
One: FSD, software that changes lanes and stops at lights on its own

4
00:00:11,311 --> 00:00:16,176
Paying users rose from 1.04 million to 1.74 million in a year

5
00:00:16,196 --> 00:00:21,132
Two: the Cybercab, a two-seat robotaxi with no wheel or pedals

6
00:00:21,152 --> 00:00:24,591
It began carrying riders in Austin in September

7
00:00:24,611 --> 00:00:29,610
Three: Optimus, a humanoid robot for simple repetitive factory work

8
00:00:29,630 --> 00:00:34,858
First outside deliveries are targeted for late 2027. The hands are still hard

9
00:00:34,878 --> 00:00:39,632
And the container-sized Megapack battery keeps about 33 won of every 100 sold

10
00:00:39,652 --> 00:00:43,727
Seed money or a burden? We checked in the full video

11
00:00:43,747 --> 00:00:46,404
